<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Unpacked customizations. The global choices (optionsets) below are ready to pack + import.
  Entity (table) XML is intentionally NOT hand-authored here: create the three tables in Studio
  per ../schema.md, then run `pac solution export` + `pac solution unpack` to capture the full,
  valid <Entities> block into this file. Hand-written entity XML rarely imports cleanly.
-->
